.TH "PACLIST" "8" "2025\-12\-11" "Pacman\-contrib 1\&.13\&.1" "راهنمای Pacman\-contrib"
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * Define some portability stuff
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
